# Vite/TS local caches. The built bundle under posawesome/public/posawesome and the
# generated www/posawesome.html are committed on purpose: they reference each other
# by content hash, and Frappe's own `bench build` does not run vite, so a fresh
# clone has to be servable without a Node toolchain.
